{"slug":"/components/mcp","title":"MCP — Getting Started — Planes","desc":"Use the shadcn MCP server to let AI agents like Claude Code and Cursor browse and install Planes components from natural language.","html":"<main class=\"min-w-0 mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 md:px-10 lg:px-14 xl:px-16\"><article class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl\"><header class=\"border-b border-border/60 pb-8\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-3xl\">MCP</h1><div class=\"shrink-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-xl bg-secondary p-1.5\"><div class=\"relative inline-flex h-8 items-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay shadow-sm\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy Page\" class=\"inline-flex h-8 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-l-md pl-2.5 pr-2 text-[13px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap text-foreground transition-[color,transform] duration-150 hover:text-foreground/80 active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring sm:pl-3\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative whitespace-nowrap hidden sm:flex\" style=\"width:auto\"><span class=\"invisible absolute\">Copy Page</span><span class=\"invisible absolute\">Copied</span><span class=\"flex\">Cop<span class=\"inline-block whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none\">y</span><span class=\"inline-block whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none\"> </span><span class=\"inline-block whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none\">P</span><span class=\"inline-block whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none\">a</span><span class=\"inline-block whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none\">g</span><span class=\"inline-block whitespace-pre\" style=\"opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none\">e</span></span></span></button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"sr-only\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-4 w-px bg-border/70\"></span><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open in an AI assistant\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"inline-flex h-8 items-center rounded-r-md px-1.5 text-foreground/60 transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-3.5 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-xl bg-secondary p-1.5\"><a aria-label=\"Previous page: Installation\" class=\"inline-flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-surface-overlay text-foreground/60 shadow-sm transition-[color,transform] duration-150 hover:text-foreground active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\" href=\"/components/installation\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg></a><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-md text-foreground/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></span></div></div></div><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-lg text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Let AI agents browse and install Planes components through the shadcn MCP server.</p></header><div class=\"flex flex-col divide-y divide-border/60 py-4 [&amp;&gt;*]:py-8 sm:[&amp;&gt;*]:py-10 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:pt-6 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:pb-0\"><section id=\"overview\" class=\"scroll-mt-24\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Overview</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">The shadcn CLI ships a Model Context Protocol server that exposes every registry configured in your <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">components.json</code> to agents like Claude Code, Cursor, and VS Code. With Planes registered, you can ask your agent to find, install, and wire up components in plain language — it resolves the registry, runs the install, and edits your code in one pass.</p></div></section><section id=\"configure-registry\" class=\"flex scroll-mt-24 gap-5 sm:gap-8\"><span class=\"pt-1 font-mono text-[12px] tabular-nums leading-6 text-muted-foreground/50\">01</span><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold leading-7 tracking-[-0.01em]\">Configure the registry</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Same one-time setup as<!-- --> <a class=\"text-foreground underline-offset-4 hover:underline\" href=\"/components/installation#pro-components\">installation</a>, so skip this step if your project is already configured. Free components install through @useplanes with no key; the <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">Authorization</code> header is only exercised for Pro components — set <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">PLANES_LICENSE_KEY</code> in your environment if you have a<!-- --> <a class=\"text-foreground underline-offset-4 hover:underline\" href=\"/#pricing\">Pro license</a>.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><div role=\"tablist\" class=\"inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-neutral-200/60 dark:bg-white/5 p-1\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_aiinpfksnksdb_-tab-cli\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"_R_aiinpfksnksdb_-panel-cli\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md px-4 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring text-foreground\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-md bg-white shadow-sm dark:bg-neutral-800\"></span><span class=\"relative z-10\">CLI</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_aiinpfksnksdb_-tab-manual\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_aiinpfksnksdb_-panel-manual\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-9 items-center rounded-md px-4 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring text-foreground/55 hover:text-foreground\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">Manual</span></button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"_R_aiinpfksnksdb_-panel-cli\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_aiinpfksnksdb_-tab-cli\" style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\"><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">One command merges the <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">@useplanes</code> registry into your<!-- --> <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">components.json</code>, writes your key to<!-- --> <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">.env.local</code>, and keeps it out of git.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-foreground/80\">Run <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">init</code> — it configures everything for you.</p><div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-[9px] w-[9px] -left-[5px] -top-[5px]\"><span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-[9px] w-[9px] -right-[5px] -top-[5px]\"><span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-[9px] w-[9px] -bottom-[5px] -left-[5px]\"><span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-[9px] w-[9px] -bottom-[5px] -right-[5px]\"><span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span></span><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-background\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-border/60 pl-4 pr-2.5\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-square-terminal size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7 11 2-2-2-2\"></path><path d=\"M11 13h4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect></svg><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Package manager\" class=\"flex items-center\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_1quqiinpfksnksdb_-tab-pnpm\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"_R_1quqiinpfksnksdb_-panel\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"relative px-2.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors duration-150 text-foreground\">pnpm<span class=\"absolute inset-x-2 -bottom-px h-px bg-foreground\"></span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_1quqiinpfksnksdb_-tab-npm\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_1quqiinpfksnksdb_-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative px-2.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors duration-150 text-muted-foreground/70 hover:text-foreground\">npm</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_1quqiinpfksnksdb_-tab-yarn\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_1quqiinpfksnksdb_-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative px-2.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors duration-150 text-muted-foreground/70 hover:text-foreground\">yarn</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_1quqiinpfksnksdb_-tab-bun\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_1quqiinpfksnksdb_-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative px-2.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors duration-150 text-muted-foreground/70 hover:text-foreground\">bun</button></div></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"relative flex size-7 select-none items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-border/70 bg-background/70 text-muted-foreground transition-[color,transform] duration-150 ease-out hover:text-foreground active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring my-1.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></div><pre role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"_R_1quqiinpfksnksdb_-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_1quqiinpfksnksdb_-tab-pnpm\" class=\"overflow-x-auto bg-muted/20 px-4 py-3.5 text-[13px] leading-6\"><code class=\"font-mono text-foreground/90\">pnpm dlx @useplanes/cli init --key your_key</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"add-server\" class=\"flex scroll-mt-24 gap-5 sm:gap-8\"><span class=\"pt-1 font-mono text-[12px] tabular-nums leading-6 text-muted-foreground/50\">02</span><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold leading-7 tracking-[-0.01em]\">Add the MCP server</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">The CLI can configure your client for you — pass <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">claude</code>,<!-- --> <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">cursor</code>, <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">vscode</code>, or<!-- --> <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">codex</code>:</p><div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-[9px] w-[9px] -left-[5px] -top-[5px]\"><span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-[9px] w-[9px] -right-[5px] -top-[5px]\"><span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-[9px] w-[9px] -bottom-[5px] -left-[5px]\"><span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute z-10 h-[9px] w-[9px] -bottom-[5px] -right-[5px]\"><span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-foreground/30 dark:bg-white/30\"></span></span><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-background\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-border/60 pl-4 pr-2.5\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-square-terminal size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7 11 2-2-2-2\"></path><path d=\"M11 13h4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect></svg><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Package manager\" class=\"flex items-center\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_ajinpfksnksdb_-tab-pnpm\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"_R_ajinpfksnksdb_-panel\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"relative px-2.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors duration-150 text-foreground\">pnpm<span class=\"absolute inset-x-2 -bottom-px h-px bg-foreground\"></span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_ajinpfksnksdb_-tab-npm\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_ajinpfksnksdb_-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative px-2.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors duration-150 text-muted-foreground/70 hover:text-foreground\">npm</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_ajinpfksnksdb_-tab-yarn\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_ajinpfksnksdb_-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative px-2.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors duration-150 text-muted-foreground/70 hover:text-foreground\">yarn</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"_R_ajinpfksnksdb_-tab-bun\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_ajinpfksnksdb_-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"relative px-2.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors duration-150 text-muted-foreground/70 hover:text-foreground\">bun</button></div></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"relative flex size-7 select-none items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-border/70 bg-background/70 text-muted-foreground transition-[color,transform] duration-150 ease-out hover:text-foreground active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring my-1.5\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></div><pre role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"_R_ajinpfksnksdb_-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_ajinpfksnksdb_-tab-pnpm\" class=\"overflow-x-auto bg-muted/20 px-4 py-3.5 text-[13px] leading-6\"><code class=\"font-mono text-foreground/90\">pnpm dlx shadcn@latest mcp init --client claude</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"cursor://anysphere.cursor-deeplink/mcp/install?name=shadcn&amp;config=eyJjb21tYW5kIjoibnB4IiwiYXJncyI6WyJzaGFkY25AbGF0ZXN0IiwibWNwIl19\" class=\"inline-flex h-8 w-fit items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-secondary px-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground transition-[background-color,transform] duration-150 hover:bg-secondary/80 active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\">Add to Cursor<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-3 text-muted-foreground/60\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">In Cursor, skip the terminal — this registers the server in one click.</p></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Or register it manually. For Claude Code, that is a<!-- --> <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">.mcp.json</code> at your project root:</p><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 z-10\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"relative flex size-7 select-none items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-border/70 bg-background/70 text-muted-foreground transition-[color,transform] duration-150 ease-out hover:text-foreground active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-muted/20 px-5 py-4 pr-16 text-[13px] leading-6\" data-language=\"json\"><code class=\"font-mono text-foreground/90\">{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;shadcn&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;shadcn@latest&quot;, &quot;mcp&quot;]\n    }\n  }\n}</code></pre></div></div></section><section id=\"try-it\" class=\"flex scroll-mt-24 gap-5 sm:gap-8\"><span class=\"pt-1 font-mono text-[12px] tabular-nums leading-6 text-muted-foreground/50\">03</span><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold leading-7 tracking-[-0.01em]\">Try it</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Restart your agent, then prompt it naturally:</p><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><li class=\"border-l border-border/60 pl-4\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[13px] leading-5 text-foreground/90\">“<!-- -->Show me the components available in the @useplanes registry<!-- -->”</p></li><li class=\"border-l border-border/60 pl-4\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[13px] leading-5 text-foreground/90\">“<!-- -->Install the command palette from @useplanes<!-- -->”</p></li><li class=\"border-l border-border/60 pl-4\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[13px] leading-5 text-foreground/90\">“<!-- -->Add the pricing table from @useplanes to my landing page<!-- -->”</p></li></ul></div></section><section id=\"agents-md\" class=\"flex scroll-mt-24 gap-5 sm:gap-8\"><span class=\"pt-1 font-mono text-[12px] tabular-nums leading-6 text-muted-foreground/50\">04</span><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-4\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold leading-7 tracking-[-0.01em]\">Tell your agent Planes exists</h2><p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">MCP lets an agent install components when asked. To have it <em>reach for</em> <!-- -->Planes unprompted, add this to your project&#x27;s <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">AGENTS.md</code> <!-- -->or <code class=\"rounded bg-foreground/10 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-foreground\">CLAUDE.md</code> — the agent then sees the catalog on every request, with no MCP call needed.</p><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute right-3 top-3 z-10\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy\" aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"relative flex size-7 select-none items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-border/70 bg-background/70 text-muted-foreground transition-[color,transform] duration-150 ease-out hover:text-foreground active:scale-[0.97] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"shrink-0 size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></path><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" opacity=\"1\" style=\"transform:none;transform-origin:50% 50%;transform-box:fill-box\"></rect><path d=\"M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5\" class=\"text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0\" pathLength=\"1\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0\" stroke-dasharray=\"0 1\"></path></svg></button></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-muted/20 px-5 py-4 pr-16 text-[13px] leading-6\" data-language=\"markdown\"><code class=\"font-mono text-foreground/90\">## UI components: Planes\n\nAnimated React components distributed as a shadcn registry. Before hand-writing an\nanimated control, carousel, text effect, hero, or login, check the catalog — it lists\nevery component with what it is for and its install command:\nhttps://useplanes.com/llms.txt (usage snippets and props: https://useplanes.com/llms-full.txt)\n\n- Free components: `npx shadcn add @useplanes/&lt;slug&gt;` (no license needed), or `npx shadcn add https://useplanes.com/r/&lt;slug&gt;.json` with no setup at all\n- Pro components (license already configured in this project): `npx shadcn add @useplanes/&lt;slug&gt;`\n\nInstalled files land in `components/ui/` as editable source. Import them from\n`@/components/ui/&lt;Name&gt;`.</code></pre></div></div></section><nav aria-label=\"Docs pagination\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/components/installation\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left size-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg>Installation</a><span></span></nav></div></article>"}